### Pruebas manuales de POST /cards (extensión REST Client de VS Code). Datos ficticios.
### Ejecútalas en orden. Si ya existe la tarjeta de prueba, la primera da 409: cambia last4.
@host = http://localhost:3001
@token = pega-aqui-el-accessToken-de-auth.http

### 1. Tarjeta válida -> 201 { "id": ... }
POST {{host}}/cards
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Visa Ficticia",
  "bank": "Banco Ejemplo",
  "last4": "4321",
  "creditLimitCents": 500000000,
  "cutDay": 15,
  "dueDay": 5,
  "rate": { "effectiveFrom": "2026-01-01", "ea": "0.2899" }
}

### 2. La misma otra vez (mismo banco y últimos 4) -> 409
POST {{host}}/cards
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Visa Ficticia",
  "bank": "Banco Ejemplo",
  "last4": "4321",
  "creditLimitCents": 500000000,
  "cutDay": 15,
  "dueDay": 5,
  "rate": { "effectiveFrom": "2026-01-01", "ea": "0.2899" }
}

### 3. cutDay fuera de rango -> 400
POST {{host}}/cards
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Visa Ficticia",
  "bank": "Banco Ejemplo",
  "last4": "1111",
  "creditLimitCents": 500000000,
  "cutDay": 40,
  "dueDay": 5,
  "rate": { "effectiveFrom": "2026-01-01", "ea": "0.2899" }
}

### 4. Un campo que no está en el DTO -> 400
POST {{host}}/cards
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Visa Ficticia",
  "bank": "Banco Ejemplo",
  "last4": "2222",
  "creditLimitCents": 500000000,
  "cutDay": 15,
  "dueDay": 5,
  "rate": { "effectiveFrom": "2026-01-01", "ea": "0.2899" },
  "color": "azul"
}

### 5. E.A. con una M.V. que no cuadra -> 400
POST {{host}}/cards
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Visa Ficticia",
  "bank": "Banco Ejemplo",
  "last4": "3333",
  "creditLimitCents": 500000000,
  "cutDay": 15,
  "dueDay": 5,
  "rate": { "effectiveFrom": "2026-01-01", "ea": "0.2899", "mv": "0.0241" }
}

### 6. E.A. de 15.000 % (150) -> 400 "fuera de rango", no un 500 de Postgres
POST {{host}}/cards
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Visa Ficticia",
  "bank": "Banco Ejemplo",
  "last4": "4444",
  "creditLimitCents": 500000000,
  "cutDay": 15,
  "dueDay": 5,
  "rate": { "effectiveFrom": "2026-01-01", "ea": "150" }
}

### 7. M.V. de 20 % mensual (su E.A. calculada sería 790 %) -> 400 "fuera de rango"
POST {{host}}/cards
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Visa Ficticia",
  "bank": "Banco Ejemplo",
  "last4": "5555",
  "creditLimitCents": 500000000,
  "cutDay": 15,
  "dueDay": 5,
  "rate": { "effectiveFrom": "2026-01-01", "mv": "0.2" }
}
